          <p class="eyebrow">My approach</p>
          <h2 id="approach-title">Evidence-informed, personal, and practical.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-body">
          <p>I draw on evidence-based therapies and adapt the work to the teen and family in front of me. Sessions can focus on understanding patterns, building coping skills, and taking small steps toward meaningful change.</p>
          <p>My clinical work includes individual therapy, family sessions, and collaboration with parents and other providers when appropriate.</p>
          <ul class="method-list" aria-label="Therapeutic approaches">
            <li>CBT</li><li>ACT</li><li>Motivational Interviewing</li><li>Solution-Focused Therapy</li>
