            <p class="eyebrow">About Kino</p>
            <h2 id="about-title">Kino Park, LCSW</h2>
            <p class="credential-line">Licensed Clinical Social Worker in Texas · MSW</p>
            <div class="about-copy">
              <p>I’m a clinical social worker with outpatient and residential behavioral-health experience. My outpatient work has focused on adolescents ages 10–19 and their families, including assessment, treatment planning, safety planning, and psychotherapy.</p>
              <p>I use approaches including CBT, ACT, motivational interviewing, and solution-focused therapy. I value a thoughtful, collaborative process that respects each teen’s voice.</p>
            </div>
